<title>Iraq: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/iraq/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-iraq-2026-11-21T19:35:09.017Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 19:35:09 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Iraqi security forces have moved into the Iran-backed militia strongholds of Jurf al-Sakhar and Jurf al-Nasr under a newly-brokered joint security command, while Prime Minister Ali al-Zaidi has also ordered a separate command for the region, expanding state control. Security forces are probing a deadly gas pipeline blast in Basra and have deployed to Jurf al-Sakhar following a deal with the militia, while also establishing new security posts to protect oil assets at Jurf Al-Nasr. Arrest warrants have been issued in Najaf for a provincial council member linked to an oil smuggling operation, and security forces are pursuing two suspects in the case. The UCDP recorded 396 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilgFBVV95cUxOSmhZODNjd292clh2TlJBYWJNV0NuQV93UWxVTmxiMmNJaHJnNHI5WFF2bVJwOHgwcmdRS21DU3lYbGQ5aXdCVW1HbjNoaVRnSlFPRThCOFdsbTd3Y0hDUlJPci04QzdVM0d0SDhqMzVEU0VQYTUzWFNSd29FeklxbTlKWk8yQnZCV3ktZlZaOFpncHhzU3c?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMi-?oc=5&quot;&gt;Kurdistan24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTE9XU1NjeGRMTlVTR2daMDM1WFNTbXVCWjRjY254eW1ZUG1HOUxMX1FkV1RhZHNPd0FjVEV1UTNPdEZoQ0VGY3FsQm5JVU5YWEI0UXJoN002cGthT0pfNWc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Rudaw&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Inshorts&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiS0FVX3lxTE53SjU5WGIxckI0T3J2Z3Bma3VocUhWOU9GMkxoZ0k1dXQ0dWdzZGJSb2N2TS01X2FKcnlMOWRDb3VnRDhNcGlGZno4OA?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New Region&lt;/a